==Dialogue==
:{{DIcon}} I'd like to buy something.
:;(Opens shop)
::'''Danvers''' Welcome! You look like you've seen battle. Whatever yoy need, just say the word! The Silver Helmet is here to serve.
:;(Purchase)
::'''Danvers''' Everything here is made with seasoned warriors in mind.
:{{DIcon}} Chat
;(At Day)
::'''Danvers''' I've had this shop for decades now.
::'''Danvers''' I used to fight too, and I watched Gladiators burn through their lives to chase their dreams. That's when I realized the glory of victory is built on pain.
::'''Danvers''' I left the arena behind after that and started this business.
::'''Danvers''' I sell good gear and honest medicine. Doing what I can to keep those Gladiators standing.
:{{DIcon|Exit}} Leave
----
;(Night)
::'''Danvers''' I knew a [[Mya|Gladiator]] once. Made it all the way to the championship. No talent to speak of, just pure heart and grit.
::'''Danvers''' When she came in to customize her gear, she looked like she could barely breathe under the weight of it all. You know, matches, expectations, everything. 
::'''Danvers''' But the moment she stepped into the arena, it was if her true self broke free from all those shackles. The arena became her whole world.
::'''Danvers''' In the end, she won. Took the title. But when the medal ceremony came... she never showed.
::'''Danvers''' Did she walk away from her triumph? Or did something stop her from reaching it?
::'''Danvers''' ...Guess that's gladiating for you.
{{Dialogue End}}

